ValidateRecipientTest
├── when recipient is address(0)
│ └── it reverts with {InvalidRecipient}
├── when recipient is the zap
│ └── it reverts with {InvalidRecipient}
├── when recipient is any other address
│ └── it succeeds
└── when recipient is invalid
    └── it reverts with {InvalidRecipient} from add, increase, rebalance, and compound
